fixed2/3/_r3 39/39, gate 13 PASS 193 each time): the detector, promoted from the
rung-3 witness (frozen byte-identical at regress/artifacts/ppcdsformxo/witness_20261024/ppc_dsform_probe.py, md5
5e96b69d; RED on HEAD 5/8).  Seven debugger-stepped guest sessions on the unmodified bareppc -M 64 (PPC970) and one negative session: loads (the three
witness words; ld/ldu/lwa at DS = 0; ld/lwa with RA = 0 from a seeded low window; lwz +8 and lwz +6, the D-form control
whose displacement has non-zero low bits), stores (std, stdu, stdu at DS = 0, stdu rA,DS(rA), std at DS = 0, std with RA = 0 (two words; their joint cell is not claimed),
stw +6; every destination read back by the debugger's dump over EA-1..EA+11, the flanks graded for the ordinary stdu only; eight
distinct source bytes except the alias store's, which is its old base), five stop
sessions (58/XO 3, 62/XO 2, 62/XO 3, ldu and stdu with RA = 0 -- a liveness li then the word LAST), the bogus-machine
control; every word from the probe's encoder; a census of all 108 placed words against the tree's CURRENT disassembler
