| GLM 5.3, Q1-Q2 firing | `ollama_glm_t2p2_Q12.txt` | 13,207 | LAND WITH CHANGES | packet-fed | Q1(a-e), Q2(a-e) only; every claim labelled READ / REASONED / NOT CHECKABLE; re-derived every leg's red set |
